From: CVM DPDK prototype <cvm@example.invalid>
Date: Tue, 20 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] mlx5: consolidate the validated conservative CVM baseline

Export the exact tree delta from fc1a57cc5aa699721d5b4496ded90a0cdfec518f
through 8a3a43b90c30122cf65710b3b56c17f9c0678bef. This includes scalar-SPRQ
restrictions, isolated RX/TX tests, fail-stop completion validation, fd
ownership fixes, fail-closed allocation, and DMA UMEM page-size alignment.
Intermediate experiments and reversions are folded into their final result.
Recovered read-only from the powered-off validation VM on 2026-10-20.

